<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.90 /10.70  11.10 /11.00    11.975/11.75</p>
<p>BPI			11.125/10.95  11.625/11.50    11.95 /11.70</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.00 /10.80  11.375/11.15    11.875/11.625</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	  11.05 /10.90  11.70 /11.50    12.00 /11.80</p>
<p>Metrobank		11.10 /10.95  11.50 /11.40    12.10 /11.95</p>
<p>Multinational	  11.00 /10.80  11.25 /11.10    12.125/11.70</p>
<p>PNB			11.00 /10.50  11.50 /11.00    12.00 /11.50</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   11.00 /10.85  11.40 /11.25    11.95 /11.75</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
